RMSNorm:  x / RMS(x) · γ

RMS(x) = √( (1/d)·Σxᵢ² )" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;arcSize=8;strokeColor=#5A6B7F;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A2332" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="232" width="280" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" value="省掉的东西：μ（一次求和归约）、β（一份参数+一次加法）
省掉的理由：归一化真正起作用的是「缩放不变性」，中心化贡献很小
收益：少一次完整的数据依赖归约 → 训练/推理都更快；参数少一半" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E1;arcSize=8;strokeColor=#5A6B7F;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A2332" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="490" width="740" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e31" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#5A6B7F;strokeWidth=1.4;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0" edge="1" parent="1" source="n5" target="n6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e32" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#5A6B7F;strokeWidth=1.4;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0" edge="1" parent="1" source="n6" target="n7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e33" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#5A6B7F;strokeWidth=1.4;exitX=0.25;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0" edge="1" parent="1" source="n3" target="n5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e34" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#5A6B7F;strokeWidth=1.4;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0" edge="1" parent="1" source="n7" target="n8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e35" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#5A6B7F;strokeWidth=1.4;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0" edge="1" parent="1" source="n10" target="n11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e36" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#5A6B7F;strokeWidth=1.4;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0" edge="1" parent="1" source="n11" target="n12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e37" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;htm